 {"i":"1ylq2ro","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:0px\">","h":"<span class=\"cs-neg-tag\">[공판정]</span> 피고인이 <span class=\"cs-red\"><strong>'공판정'에서 자백</strong></span>하여야 — <span class=\"cs-gbg\">[공판준비절차에서의 자백]</span> <span class=\"cs-x\"><strong>(X)</strong></span>","k":"4n4jyh"},
